-semantic.html","group":"1. Foundations","viewport":"720x330","subtitle":"The semantic --t-* aliases components actually reference","name":"Surfaces, borders, text"},{"path":"guidelines/05-colors-tags.html","group":"1. Foundations","viewport":"720x200","subtitle":"Select / enum values: background = hue step 3, text = hue step 11. Avatars use step 4 / step 12.","name":"Tag hue pairs"},{"path":"guidelines/06-type-scale.html","group":"1. Foundations","viewport":"720x330","subtitle":"Inter only. Root is 13px; --t-font-size-md (1rem) is the UI size for buttons, cells, menus, labels.","name":"Type scale"},{"path":"guidelines/07-spacing-radius.html","group":"1. Foundations","viewport":"720x260","subtitle":"spacing(n) = n × 4px. Radii: xs 2 (avatars) · sm 4 (chips, tags, cells, cards) · md 8 (buttons, panels, menus). Control heights 24 / 32.","name":"Spacing, radius, heights"},{"path":"guidelines/08-iconography.html","group":"1. Foundations","viewport":"720x1470","subtitle":"Tabler webfont. Sidebar cấp 1 = tile 16px radius 4px, nền hue nhạt + viền hairline cùng hue + glyph 14px hue đậm (đo từ ảnh sản phẩm); menu con = tile xám --t-background-quaternary + glyph 14px second","name":"Iconography"},{"path":"guidelines/09-shadow-motion.html","group":"1. Foundations","viewport":"720x170","subtitle":"Three shadows only. Hover fills transition at 0.1s; layout moves at 0.3s (normal), reveals at 0.15s (fast).","name":"Shadow + motion"},{"path":"components/core/01-buttons.card.html","group":"2. Core","viewport":"640x160","subtitle":"Variant × accent, sizes, disabled, hotkeys","name":"Buttons"},{"path":"components/core/02-icon-buttons.card.html","group":"2. Core","viewport":"640x110","subtitle":"Light / secondary variants, accents, sizes, chevron pair","name":"Icon Buttons"},{"path":"components/core/03-chips.card.html","group":"2. Core","viewport":"640x140","subtitle":"Như trang Customers: person chip (rounded avatar, highlighted), label chip (avatar={false}), ValuePill cho phone/email